### 伺服器基礎變數
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. 取得所有帳目 (Read)
# 用於確認目前資料庫中所有的收支紀錄
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

###

### 2. 新增一筆支出 (Create)
# 測試新增一筆今天的餐飲消費
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "美味午餐",
  "amount": 120,
  "type": "expense",
  "category": "餐飲",
  "date": "2026-01-12"
}

###

### 3. 新增一筆收入 (Create)
# 測試新增一筆薪資收入
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "一月薪資",
  "amount": 50000,
  "type": "income",
  "category": "薪資",
  "date": "2026-01-05"
}

